  - id: FK_P05_03_N2
    speaker: "Liam Bryce"
    line: "Margo worked out the real price and posted her a cheque for the difference. With a note. Don't be a martyr, it said."
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P05_03_N3
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P05_03_N3
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "That was fourteen years ago. They were friends from that day."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
